  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.1 featuring:\n      - Enhanced SQL Injection protection with parameterized query validation\n      - Advanced XSS protection with output encoding and input sanitization\n      - Improved CSRF protection with token validation\n      - Enhanced JWT security with issuer validation and replay detection\n      - Advanced rate limiting with configurable policies\n      - Packet-level encryption middleware\n      - Secure CORS configuration\n      - Enhanced security headers middleware\n      - Comprehensive configuration options with better defaults\n      - High performance with minimal overhead\n      - Real-time security metrics via SignalR\n      - Enhanced configuration flexibility for microservices",
